    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Flesh and Spirit</i> is a mythic action-adventure set in the antediluvian world \u2014 the forgotten age before the Great Cataclysm. You play as a chosen Guardian, a protector of the scattered remnants of humanity, facing off against the monstrous giants (Nephilim) and twisted creatures that roam a corrupted Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world moves closer to the brink of annihilation, you must navigate a land steeped in ancient power, lost civilizations, and dark supernatural forces. The line between flesh and spirit is thin; your choices will determine not just your survival, but the destiny of those you are sworn to protect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711750/extras/8787665ef68ab2607e298ddb96064e23.poster.avif?t=1746135108\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711750/extras/8787665ef68ab2607e298ddb96064e23.webm?t=1746135108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711750/extras/8787665ef68ab2607e298ddb96064e23.mp4?t=1746135108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast, decaying landscapes inspired by ancient myths. Engage in brutal, skill-based combat against overwhelming foes. Uncover hidden knowledge that challenges everything you know about creation, rebellion, and sacrifice. In a time when humanity is caught between divine judgment and monstrous terror, will you hold onto the mortal world \u2014 or transcend it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end is near. Flesh withers. Spirit endures. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Flesh and Spirit</i> is a mythic action-adventure set in the antediluvian world \u2014 the forgotten age before the Great Cataclysm. You play as a chosen Guardian, a protector of the scattered remnants of humanity, facing off against the monstrous giants (Nephilim) and twisted creatures that roam a corrupted Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world moves closer to the brink of annihilation, you must navigate a land steeped in ancient power, lost civilizations, and dark supernatural forces. The line between flesh and spirit is thin; your choices will determine not just your survival, but the destiny of those you are sworn to protect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711750/extras/8787665ef68ab2607e298ddb96064e23.poster.avif?t=1746135108\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711750/extras/8787665ef68ab2607e298ddb96064e23.webm?t=1746135108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711750/extras/8787665ef68ab2607e298ddb96064e23.mp4?t=1746135108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast, decaying landscapes inspired by ancient myths. Engage in brutal, skill-based combat against overwhelming foes. Uncover hidden knowledge that challenges everything you know about creation, rebellion, and sacrifice. In a time when humanity is caught between divine judgment and monstrous terror, will you hold onto the mortal world \u2014 or transcend it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end is near. Flesh withers. Spirit endures. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
